<model>
  <name>Silbot Test</name>
  <version>1.0</version>
  <sdf version="1.5">model.sdf</sdf>
  <description>Primitive-shape stand-in for the real Silbot robot (white hourglass torso, bent arms, tablet face with a cartoon expression, round wheeled base), built on the same TurtleBot3 burger physics as silbot_label. Spawned alongside silbot_01 for a visual realism check before deciding whether to replace it.</description>
